   "url": "https://x.com/OliviaTrustyFCC/status/2029608233849983107",
   "text": "focused on the future of AI, secure networks, and resilient infrastructure.\n\nI was honored to participate in the Caribbean and Pacific Island Roundtable discussion, where",
   "source_type": "x",
   "attribution": {
    "kind": "official_role",
